This repository contains only authored source, documentation and synthetic
fixtures. It redistributes no game data, no Plutonium files and no third-party
program. Setup downloads the following programs from their upstream releases on
the user's machine; each remains under its own license:

  OpenAssetTools      GPL-3.0     https://github.com/Laupetin/OpenAssetTools
  gsc-tool            GPL-3.0     https://github.com/xensik/gsc-tool
  CoDLuaDecompiler    MIT         https://github.com/JariKCoding/CoDLuaDecompiler
  FFmpeg (BtbN build) GPL         https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds
  Blender             GPL-3.0     https://www.blender.org
  Cast (Blender add-on) MIT       https://github.com/dtzxporter/cast
  Greyhound           GPL-3.0     https://github.com/Scobalula/Greyhound
  Husky               GPL-3.0     https://github.com/Scobalula/Husky
  C2Mv3               unspecified https://github.com/o-Astral-o/C2Mv3  (optional; binary only)

The toolkit invokes these programs as separate processes and does not link
against them. Review each upstream license before sharing an installed tree.

